{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08780","headline":"拟古十二首 十 · 李白","name":"拟古十二首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙人骑彩凤，昨下阆风岑。\n海水三清浅，桃源一见寻。\n遗我绿玉桮，兼之紫琼琴。\n杯以倾美酒，琴以闲素心。\n二物非世有，何论珠与金。\n琴弹松里风，桮劝天上月。\n风月长相知，世人何倏忽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}